    fix(cli): unknown tool-call outcome is never replayed or reported as failure (I-EFFECT-1/2/3)

    - mcp: tools/call over HTTP is posted once; ambiguous delivery -> outcomeUnknown, only 404/405/501 falls back
    - spine: unknown outcome (timeout/lost connection) marks candidate mutated, receipt says UNKNOWN
    - resume: an identical call re-issued after an interrupted one needs approval (argsHash write-ahead)

